One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch,
Wishing to send him to her master before
The brave storm, in whose quest he fell.
But he had thee so far from home that he did not stop,
Or, full strong of grief and outcast,
Spending him as much in expenses
As he could carry, such barren hand!
  These wasteful looks false lovers enjoy;
  They spend it on themselves, on themselves faring far worse.


